{"id":"89c266445c099752","group":"92","path":"92/92-ax-peano-arithmetic.md","title":"Peano Arithmetic Axioms","display":"ax-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic Axioms","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","aliases":["92-ax-peano-arithmetic"],"display":"ax-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic Axioms","depends_on":["[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-induction-schema]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-universal-closure]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 45–47、57）","source_status":"本地等价 PA 呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ax-peano-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic Axioms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"302b3328b775d21b\" href=\"?note=302b3328b775d21b\" title=\"92-df-universal-closure\">92-df-universal-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 45–47、57）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地等价 PA 呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variables, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_G\\)</span> (induction-schema constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (definition-target axiom set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall x\\,\\neg(S(x)=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(S(x)=S(y)\\to x=y),\\\n\\forall x(x+0=x),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x+S(y)=S(x+y)),\\\n\\forall x(x\\cdot0=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\\}\n\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall x\\,\\neg(S(x)=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(S(x)=S(y)\\to x=y),\\\n\\forall x(x+0=x),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x+S(y)=S(x+y)),\\\n\\forall x(x\\cdot0=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\\}\n\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> : Peano算术公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA1, PA2\">\\(PA1, PA2\\)</span>：后继永不为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>为单射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>的函数性已由一阶函数符号的语义保证，并不是第二条公理的内容</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA3, PA4\">\\(PA3, PA4\\)</span> : 加法递归定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA5, PA6\">\\(PA5, PA6\\)</span> : 乘法递归定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA7\">\\(PA7\\)</span> : 数学归纳公理模式</li>\n<li>本文件采用六条非归纳公理加完整一阶归纳模式；常见的其他等价公理化可能另列“每个非零数是后继”等可在本版本中导出的句子</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文件是等式语言中的六公理 PA 呈现，原书 P.E. 有七条逻辑模式、十一条基本算术公式和归纳；P.A. 删除两个指数公理并限制语言。现有公理不是原书十九模式的逐字抄写。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 45–47、57）。</p>\n<p>开放参数归纳实例仍保留在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> 中；若需要闭句公理集，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\)</span>，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"302b3328b775d21b\" href=\"?note=302b3328b775d21b\" title=\"92-df-universal-closure\">92-df-universal-closure</a>。两种呈现有相同模型和闭句定理；不把它们当作字面相同集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"302b3328b775d21b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variables, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_G$ (induction-schema constructor, see [[92-df-induction-schema]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"302b3328b775d21b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"开放参数归纳实例仍保留在 $\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ 中；若需要闭句公理集，使用 $\\mathrm{PA}^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]$，见[[92-df-universal-closure]]。两种呈现有相同模型和闭句定理；不把它们当作字面相同集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\